@startuml
actor Op as "Operator"
participant UI as "MES UI (Browser)"
participant API as "MES API"
participant Cache as "Redis Cache"
database DB as "MES DB"

Op -> UI: Click "Start order"
UI -> API: POST /orders/{id}/status\n{ status: MANUFACTURING_STARTED }

API -> DB: UPDATE orders\nSET status=...\nWHERE id={id}
DB --> API: OK

API -> Cache: DEL orders:item:{id}
API -> Cache: DEL orders:list:status=NEW:page=*
API -> Cache: DEL orders:list:status=IN_PROGRESS:operator={opId}:page=*

API --> UI: 200 OK
UI --> Op: Status updated

@enduml